  "description": "CR 715.3a, 715.2b, 715.4, 613.1f, 510.2, 104.3e, 800.4a, 120.3: Summon: Primal Odin's chapter I destroys a creature an opponent controls; chapter II gives it a trigger that makes a player it deals combat damage to lose the game; chapter III draws two and each player loses 2 life, and the Saga is then sacrificed",
